===
title: "Use EBS volumes instead of local NVMe drives?"
subTitle: First-principles pro/con map for CloudNativePG storage on EKS — gp3 EBS volumes through the CSI driver, which this template's default storage class provides, versus instance-store NVMe on storage-optimized nodes with durability delegated entirely to Postgres replication
author: Claude and 3uzbcqje
date: 2026-09-01
